{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "f68ae7868ba08b9c2cdafc3e35c2c2afb6e4f5dc90138d86ef1d684bef0767bf", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# EXM-01 — Examiner Report Synthesis"}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "ca21ca6be1085dba25071973e16ce37c5adf4288d536f661886f6478cbbd1801", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact synthesises the structure and voice of the official 4CH1 examiner\nreports held in the corpus of record: what a report contains, how it speaks about performance, and\nwhich recurring commentary forms it uses. Every claim is carried on a bounded,\npage-located excerpt from the run's evidence pack, with paper/session identity\npreserved per the EXM family's citation law. Research artifact; canonical planes\nuntouched."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "a3239160d5f64d695636031f248e4d7a4811cd576582441bfbf8bcb898bf4709", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** report structure; overall-performance statements; question-by-question\ncommentary; the not-creditworthy ruling class; general-reminder passages;\nlegacy-transition notes.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-ER-4CH1 (the 2019-06 1C/1CR/2C/2CR reports of the pack, pages\n3-4 of each — the commentary zone after cover and boilerplate) and SRC-QPMS-4CH1\n(paper identity headers).\n\n**Out of scope:** warning/reward/penalty catalogues (EXM-02..EXM-04),\nquestion-specific insights (EXM-05)."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "c7a5f1abe36772bb90f45f4f0632bc165e0f88f763b62e86a27bf982e0b48693", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nEach report runs cover → publisher boilerplate → an introduction with an\noverall-performance statement → question-by-question commentary. The voice is\noperational: it says what was well answered, what was not, and — most valuably for\nteaching — why answers failed (repeating the stem is \"not creditworthy\"; an\nobservation must be an observation). The 2019 reports also carry a historic frame:\nfirst examination of the new specification, with paper-length notes against the\nlegacy model. The corpus's session coverage is partial by design (no public ER for\nCOVID-era and some January/November sittings — disclosed in the source manifest of\nrecord), so synthesis here stays within the held sessions."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "be3a715864833e1d595034871ed04234b2a54067b34471f0df2e714929c82bea", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-ER-4CH1 — the 2019-06 1C/1CR/2C/2CR examiner-report PDFs\n(page-located excerpts from the commentary zone; per-file identity carried by the\npaper-dir paths, per-file sha256 recorded in the source manifest of record).\nSRC-QPMS-4CH1 provides paper-identity headers in the pack. Reports are commentary on\nthe official papers — paper identity cites ride on SRC-QPMS-4CH1 per the source\nmanifest's own limitation note. Session coverage limits (8/16 held sessions; the\ngarbled 2024-06 1C ER excluded of record) are disclosed in the run receipts."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "91dfe10e02dbc771d9a0f837562b64d95f5b0151521dfad57fa8656c7faf79f4", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe synthesis anchors on the four 2019-06 reports of the pack; later held sessions\n(2022-2025) are analysed in the sibling EXM artifacts whose packs hold them. Sessions\nwithout public ERs (COVID-era, some January/November sittings) and the silver-tier\nNov-2025/June-2026 PEFs are source gaps of record — disclosed, never filled. No\ncanonical planes were written."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:rec:EXM-001", "content_sha256": "9ac43df403ab4662f2b99bf1a3a89d00d30395e4a8ed74b6923ecc1b152e264d", "heading": "EXM-001", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-001", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-001", "text": "### EXM-001 — The report corpus and its page structure\n\n**Claim:** the held reports follow a stable structure — cover, boilerplate,\nintroduction, then question-by-question commentary from page 3 onward.\n**Evidence:** the 2019-06 1C report's page 3 opens the \"Introduction\" and its page 4\nruns \"Question 2 (b)\" commentary (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p3, p4); the\n1CR report's page 3 opens directly with \"Question 1\" commentary after its title\nblock (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:rec:EXM-002", "content_sha256": "1a1d41cffe3839c9e26cc85e88948c8a70ae4d402ed48c53956f548602e7c416", "heading": "EXM-002", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-002", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-002", "text": "### EXM-002 — Overall-performance statements in the introduction\n\n**Claim:** reports open with an overall performance judgement that frames the\nquestion commentary.\n**Evidence:** \"Introduction This is the first time the new specification for\nInternational GCSE has been examined. Taking this into account candidates generally\nperformed well on this paper. The first four questions were answered well by the\nmajority of candidates, but the later questions proved more challenging.\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:rec:EXM-003", "content_sha256": "700902cf1b4a8b76fb6cb9eb284b1c6ab3596db435e298a92c6ef9c28a0a6f66", "heading": "EXM-003", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-003", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-003", "text": "### EXM-003 — The question-by-question commentary form\n\n**Claim:** commentary is organised per question part with a performance verdict plus\nfailure analysis.\n**Evidence:** \"Question 2 (b) This question was well answered by the majority of\ncandidates. Those who did not score here often just stated that the elements were in\nthe same group...\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p4); the 2CR report's\nQuestion 1 note on the oxygen test (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2CR/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:rec:EXM-004", "content_sha256": "7bb0073afdc68b414fb69d6a0cff3619d019cd55d5d2cde433e4fe187f30c0dc", "heading": "EXM-004", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-004", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-004", "text": "### EXM-004 — The not-creditworthy ruling class\n\n**Claim:** reports rule named answer types non-creditworthy explicitly.\n**Evidence:** \"...often just stated that the elements were in the same group, which\nwas just a repeat of the stem of the question and is, therefore, not creditworthy.\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:rec:EXM-005", "content_sha256": "b6dea6127af9b537a49f84df7e54a10f6c59031c6b0ab26171b79192708b9886", "heading": "EXM-005", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-005", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-005", "text": "### EXM-005 — General-reminder passages\n\n**Claim:** reports embed general candidate reminders (presentation, terminology)\nalongside question commentary.\n**Evidence:** \"In general, candidates should be reminded that clear handwriting is\nimportant, and it should be absolutely clear which letter they mean...\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "chunk_id": "EXM-01:rec:EXM-006", "content_sha256": "0254573d64fc81ee48992032630f7b4f1662491db2ddab574a952fa9cc7caae0", "heading": "EXM-006", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-01", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-012", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "0261a2b908751ac5c0a4331c1f7463c4956ec664"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-006", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-006", "text": "### EXM-006 — Legacy-transition notes\n\n**Claim:** the first-session reports carry transition framing against the legacy\nspecification, including paper-length change.\n**Evidence:** \"This was the first time candidates had sat this new specification\npaper. The style of this paper is very similar to that of the legacy specification\nbut has increased from 60 to 70 marks.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
